{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方的大号白字和薄荷绿强调词，尤其是“舒舒服服地待在这份亲近里”“沉默也很舒服”；随后下方同样醒目的大号引语吸引视线。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"两个人正处在亲近、安静的相处中，他想舒服地留在这种亲近里。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、安静、喜欢；是否夹杂犹豫和失落，第一眼不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他具体想表达有多喜欢、想确认对方是否也有同样感受，却没想好怎么开口，最后念头淡去。这层完整的心理过程需要读下方引语才能理解。中间水波和思绪的比喻也不容易第一眼抓到。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上方绿字和下方灰白色大字都比较显眼，主视线需要在两块之间切换。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在上、下两块大字里，需要拼接才能理解亲近中的舒适感与想表达却未开口之间的关系。\",\n    \"上方单块文字较长，包含相处状态、身体感受和内心变化几层意思。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d5da2b69-b8fc-465e-ae64-bba84185bed7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T010857153106Z", "elapsed_seconds": 38.234, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:09:35.400092+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "99ed0b4f2c6f08a226dedf5832e1e02578741627d13e3c87645ef8001555e2d6", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f